d_at":"2025-09-07T03:09:58Z","body":"had the same issue using v4.4.1.stable.nixpkgs.49a5bc7b6\nseems to be weirdly version specific? i dunno but yeah reloading the scene makes it work fine so not much of an issue","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263415019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677357466","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103591#issuecomment-3677357466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103591","id":3677357466,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bMAWa","user":{"login":"belzecue","id":1931303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzEzMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1931303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue","html_url":"https://github.com/belzecue","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/belzecue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-20T04:15:54Z","updated_at":"2025-12-20T04:15:54Z","body":"> I was experiencing the same problem on Windows, but I discovered that Scene -> Reload Saved Scene fixes that.\n\nThis does not fix the issue on Debian 12 for me.  Only closing and reopening the scene clears the error.  \n\nThe [doco says](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/editor/script_editor.html) \"Soft Reload Tool Script: If the selected script is a tool, reloads the script to execute it again.\"  Seems like it's broken on Linux and maybe MacOS, based on repros reported so far.\n\nDevice: Godot v4.5.1.stable - Debian GNU/Linux 12 (bookworm) 12 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Graphics (ADL-N) - Intel(R) N100 (4 threads) - 7.49 GiB memory","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3677357466/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3828132254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103591#issuecomment-3828132254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103591","id":3828132254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kLKme","user":{"login":"brean","id":229768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTc2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean","html_url":"https://github.com/brean","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brean/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":